+# Local rehearsal ownership
+
+Monish owns triage, Laya, Grok, persistence, and the mission UI on triage.
+The fly team owns the reflex and connectome on fly/connectome.
+
+The user authorized this local rehearsal/triage-fly branch to merge both
+halves and prototype the browser inspection hook and incomplete-flight result
+semantics. Export patches outside the repository for Monish to review. Never
+push this branch or merge/push into main or triage.
+
+Part A owns only web/vite.config.ts and is the only published work, on
+fly/connectome. Part B reads but does not edit web/src/scene/flight.ts; the
+cloud scene agent retains ownership of it.
+
+The reflex is a CPU process on port 8001. The mission is on port 8000.
+The browser bridges them, and the live connectome consumes reflex activity.
+Do not add imports between the two Python processes. Hardware performance
+must be measured on each machine; this rehearsal is on the Windows laptop.
